<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Cydsa eyes floating shares.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Cydsa eyes floating shares.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textile and chemical group Cydsa SA will propose to shareholders the approval of a project to issue unsubscribed shares, the company said.</p>
<p>Cydsa, announcing the proposal in statements published in local media, said the move will be put to the annual general meeting of the company on April 23.</p>
<p>((-- Daniel Perez-Whitaker, Monterrey bureau +528 3457617))</p>
</text>
